{"version":1,"content":"<p>長期以來，科學界普遍認為彗星曾將生命形成所需的關鍵化學原料帶到地球，為早期生命誕生創造條件。然而，英國劍橋大學領導的一項最新研究對這一經典理論提出了挑戰。研究人員通過先進計算機模擬發現，彗星將生命前體分子成功送達地球表面的可能性遠低於此前設想，甚至可以説極其罕見。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585012.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:45:52.444883+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.336701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.336701+00:00","content_hash":"9918b60e0949c551944b8959a0e92604f5249fb57ffde21e3dfae0dbbc45ff81","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}